  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A telegraph line of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math> has a capacity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>km</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and it carries an alternating current at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;kilo cycle per second. If minimum impedance is required, then the value of the inductance that needs to be introduced in series is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mH</mi></math>. (If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "100",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The frequency given is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;kilo cycle per second&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>Total capacitance of the wire is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>.</p><p>Impedance is minimum at resonance. Therefore, for minimum impedance</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mn>1000</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
